{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;A roguelike that scratches the post-Balatro itch&quot; - Qualbert </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Beautifully simple and utterly engrossing&quot; - The Escapist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike deckbuilder where every roll matters. Build devastating skull combos, play poker-style dice hands, and challenge the guardian of the Underworld. How far can you push your luck before Kalma claims your soul?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/de3b2f84fcbdbdef70b7c85a2eccd5dc.gif?t=1774343488\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/de3b2f84fcbdbdef70b7c85a2eccd5dc.poster.avif?t=1774343488\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll the dice and build poker hands to score points </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect skulls that transform bad rolls into winning combos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your favorite hands for massive multipliers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck or play it safe, the choice is yours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/41c7ce311d87013b2055e36e1f7608eb.poster.avif?t=1774343488\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/41c7ce311d87013b2055e36e1f7608eb.webm?t=1774343488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/41c7ce311d87013b2055e36e1f7608eb.mp4?t=1774343488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A DECK OF SKULLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ unique skulls with game-changing abilities\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 upgradeable poker hands </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, atmospheric pixel art </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards and achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/72290c4a07b23b33aaa2a10c1c7bb0d7.poster.avif?t=1774343488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/72290c4a07b23b33aaa2a10c1c7bb0d7.webm?t=1774343488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY HANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate as many skulls as possible with every hand and use your rerolls to gain every advantage you can. Upgrade chosen hands to increase their value and complement your deck of skulls to meet increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/79eb0bb843d451f69f1599ba859c19c1.poster.avif?t=1774343488\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/79eb0bb843d451f69f1599ba859c19c1.webm?t=1774343488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885520/extras/79eb0bb843d451f69f1599ba859c19c1.mp4?t=1774343488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=